      { t: "需求与思路",
        h: "<p>不借助任何库，从 malloc 一个结点开始，实现：头插建表、遍历打印、按值删除、整表释放。这章是指针能力的试金石——<b>每行代码都建议在纸上画出结点和箭头再写</b>。</p>" },
      { t: "参考实现",
        h: "<p>先通读理解，再照着手敲一遍（不要复制粘贴），最后合上参考独立默写。默不出来就回来看，直到能写出来为止。</p>",
        code: "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <stdlib.h>\n\ntypedef struct Node {\n    int data;\n    struct Node *next;\n} Node;\n\nNode *create_node(int v)\n{\n    Node *n = malloc(sizeof(Node));\n    if (n == NULL)\n        return NULL;\n    n->data = v;\n    n->next = NULL;\n    return n;\n}\n\nNode *head_insert(Node *head, int v)\n{\n    Node *n = create_node(v);\n    if (n == NULL) return head;     /* 失败则保持原表 */\n    n->next = head;\n    return n;                        /* 新头 */\n}\n\nvoid print_all(Node *head)\n{\n    for (Node *p = head; p != NULL; p = p->next)\n        printf(\"%d -> \", p->data);\n    printf(\"NULL\\n\");\n}\n\nNode *delete_val(Node *head, int v)\n{\n    Node *cur = head, *prev = NULL;\n    while (cur && cur->data != v) {  /* 找目标 */\n        prev = cur;\n        cur = cur->next;\n    }\n    if (cur == NULL)\n        return head;                 /* 没找到 */\n    if (prev == NULL)\n        head = cur->next;            /* 删的是头结点 */\n    else\n        prev->next = cur->next;      /* 跨过 cur */\n    free(cur);\n    return head;\n}\n\nvoid free_all(Node *head)\n{\n    while (head) {\n        Node *t = head;              /* 先存住下一个再 free */\n        head = head->next;\n        free(t);\n    }\n}" },
      { t: "常见错误清单",
        h: "<ul><li>free(cur) 之前先把 cur-&gt;next 存走 → 先 free 后访问 = use after free</li><li>删除头结点没单独处理 → head 失效，整条链丢失</li><li>malloc 不判 NULL → 内存耗尽时解引用 NULL</li><li>画不出图硬写指针 → 十写九错。先画箭头图，再翻译成代码</li></ul>" }
