      code: "/* 数值夹紧\n *\n * // @case clamp(5,1,3) => 3\n * // @case clamp(0,1,3) => 1\n * // @case clamp(2,3,1) => 2\n */\nint clamp(int v, int lo, int hi)\n{\n    if (lo > hi) return v;\n    if (v < lo) return lo;\n    if (v > hi) return hi;\n    return v;\n}\n",
      exp: "内存与边界思维的前置：先定义合法区间。"
