        code: "project/\n  app/         业务状态机、任务入口\n  service/     协议、组包、存储\n  driver/      uart/adc/flash/at\n  platform/    os/log/fault/tick\n  board/       引脚与板级参数\n  tests/       单测与 HIL 脚本\n  docs/        接口/需求/风险\n\n/* 换板 = 只改 board/ + 少量 driver */",
